---
title: Bounded process cancellation and lease reconciliation (implemented)
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Caller as Caller (shutdown, run control, operator)
  participant PS as ProcessSupervisor
  participant Store as ApplicationStore
  participant Host as ProcessHost (NativeProcessHost)
  participant RS as ResourceService
  Caller->>PS: cancel(scope) / shutdown(grace, bound)
  PS->>Store: record Stopping (attributed)
  PS->>Host: cooperative stop of the whole tree (group / Job Object)
  alt tree empties within the grace period
    Host-->>PS: empty
    PS->>Store: Reaped { graceful: true } + lease reconciliation (one unit of work)
  else still running at the grace deadline
    PS->>Host: forced kill of the tree
    alt verified gone within the shared bound
      PS->>Store: Reaped { graceful: false }
    else not verifiable (escaped descendant, lost handle)
      PS->>Store: Uncertain(observed) — a physical lease it serves stays Uncertain
    end
  end
  alt the record cannot be written
    PS-->>Caller: StopFailure { outcome, error } — the native stop still ran
  end
  PS->>RS: reconcile(cause)
  RS->>Store: settle leases: Releasing/Uncertain → Reconciled only when every serving tree settled
  RS->>Store: promote the next waiter (fresh fencing token)
  PS-->>Caller: ShutdownReport { stopped, reconciliation }
